        "comments": "The assembly bAcrSch1.hap2.1 is based on 32x Oxford Nanopore data and Arima2 Hi-C data generated by the Darwin Tree of Life Project (https://www.darwintreeoflife.org/). The assembly process included the following sequence of steps: initial Oxford Nanopore assembly generation with Hifiasm in Hi-C integrated assembly mode, and Hi-C based scaffolding with YaHS. MicroFinder was used to order scaffolds prior to curation. Finally, each haplotype assembly was analysed and manually improved using TreeVal. Chromosome Z was identified by alignment to GCA_965287075.1 (Acrocephalus paludicola)",
